senses.gloss:
सञ्-चयन, अम्, n. the act of piling together,
heaping up, putting together, collecting, gathering;
collecting the ashes or bones of a body lately burnt.

सञ्-चिन्तित, अस्, आ, अम्, thought about, delibe-
rated, weighed; designed, intended (for an office);
appointed.

सञ्चुद् सञ्-चुद् (सम्-च्˚), Caus. -चोदयति,
-यितुम्, to impel, push on, incite, drive, shoot off;
to excite, inflame, arouse, animate, instigate, further;
to brandish, wield; to summon, challenge; to pro-
cure quickly, assist to obtain (Ved.).

सञ्छद् 2. सञ्-छद् or सञ्-छन्द् (सम्-छ्˚;
see rt. 3. छद्), Caus. -छदयति, -छन्दयति, -यि-
तुम्, to gratify with anything (inst.), present, offer.

सञ्-छन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, entirely covered or en-
veloped, concealed, hidden, obscure; surrounded;
invested, clothed.
